<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal investment fund assets up 19 pct yr/yr 96.</title>
<headline>Portugal investment fund assets up 19 pct yr/yr 96.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Assets held by Portuguese investment funds grew more than 19 percent year-on-year in 1996 to at least 2,500 billion escudos, the president of the Portuguese Association of Investment Fund Managers said.</p>
<p>Jose Carlos Maia told Reuters that the assets of property funds grew 31 percent year-on-year to more than 400 billion escudos.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
